Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,PosFlow | Supervisor cash control
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:21.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Prepare and seal cash bundles\Nbefore moving them into custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:28.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Permissions separate preparation,\Ncashier closing and supervisor review.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:44.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,A blind count compares physical cash\Nagainst the expected drawer balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:51.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Differences are routed for review\Ninstead of silently closing the till.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:58.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The supervisor explains and resolves\Nthe operational exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:01.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,The final report preserves a complete audit trail.
